<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  German.

  Short on purpose. This is a round 480 pixel face read at arm's length with the hands
  on the controls, and German runs longer than English almost everywhere – so several
  of these are not literal translations but the shortest wording that says the same
  thing. "Fluginformationsdienst" is correct and does not fit; "Flugleitung" does.

  The aviation vocabulary is deliberately left alone. NOTAM, METAR, ATIS, GS, ALT and
  the rest are the same words in a German cockpit, and translating them would make the
  screen harder to read rather than easier.
-->
